    "mnemonic": "This is the transitive version of <ja>現れる</ja> (to appear), so rather than something appearing on its own, you’re making it appear. So this word means <vocabulary>to show</vocabulary>, but it’s usually used in set phrases like 姿を現す (to show up) or 正体を現す (to reveal one's true nature).",
